  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Setlist help needed**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Setlist help needed**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Setlist help needed**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Setlist help needed**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **sl2008-01-05.Schoeps_mk4-cmc6.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 4 songs; 98 min [1]. Said about its sound: Taper accidentally switched off phantom power to one mic, spent about ten minutes troubleshooting cables and settings, and the problem persisted [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Set actually took place after midnight on 6 January, starting 12:45am, though the Jam Cruise schedule listed it under 5 January [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **sl2008-01-05.Schoeps_mk4-cmc6.flac16**: taped by kluyfrtliu; transferred by kluyfrtliu; source: Schoeps mk4 -> Sound Devices 722 [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK4/CMC6 microphones into a Sound Devices 722 at 24-bit/44.1k, edited in Wavelab 4 with UV22 HR dither, then converted to FLAC [1]",
